⛵ ship stack · 3 layers on main, bottom first

  Keys
    Enter            ship (in a text field: next line)
    Ctrl+Enter, F2   ship from anywhere, a text field included
    Ctrl+L           commit locally only: no push, no pull request
    ↑ ↓              previous or next line
    Tab, Shift+Tab   next or previous layer
    Shift+↑ ↓, K J   on a layer: move it one place up or down the list
                     on a file: move it to the layer above or below
    1 to 9           on a file: move it to that layer
    ?                this help (outside a text field)
    Esc, Ctrl+C      cancel: nothing changes

  The list starts with the bottom layer, the one based on the default branch.
  Any key closes this help.
